<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>A LIST</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
            
        <header>

            </header>
        
        <main>
            <h1>Mural of good music and average reviews</h1>
            <div class="main-content">   
             <p>Here we want to talk about music, albums and good covers. I'm Augusto Magalhães 40yo student of javascript, from home!, so take easy with me if code is not so polished and my english is a little bit "jamaican" cuz i live in Brazil, enjoy our little talks and stay with us.</p>
             <br/>
             <p>Some of the albums i can talk about are:</p>
             <br/>
             <ul>
                <% albums.forEach(album => { %>
                <li>
                <a href="/posts/<%= album.id %>">
                    <%= album.title %> - <%= album.artist %>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <% }); %>
            </ul>
            </div>
            </main>       
        
        <footer>
            <h2>Augusto Magalhaes - 2026</h2>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>